stion" "q-11005" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "\\frac{3}{2}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14038613/state.json" "file_sha256" "bc35bd6dab8ed8fa692798aa9d5f88b837662be61c1f40eeda757934179e89ad" "basis" 1311 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14038613/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-49178" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14039918/assets/ee37408e644416b0fe2d127703e6c5b531ae469e92d4119436fbb7f2b93ef573.png)\n\nA region in the $x$-$y$ plane is bounded by the curve $y=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\frac{1}{x}$, the $x$-axis and the lines $x=1$ and $x=\\pi $, as shown above. The area of the region is" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14039918/state.json" "file_sha256" "44ec1632c3b5a1a9cc6f9ea87ed45cee2f5e75c2c11649b02c1231f992a01a04" "basis" 1394 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14039918/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-49178" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To find the area, we just need to compute the corresponding definite integral:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & ={\\int }_{a}^{b}y(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{\\pi }(\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\frac{1}{x})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+\\operatorname{ln}⁡x){|}_{1}^{\\pi } \\\\  & =(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\pi +\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\pi )-(-\\operatorname{cos}⁡1+\\operatorname{ln}⁡1) \\\\  & =1+\\operatorname{ln}⁡\\pi +\\operatorname{cos}⁡1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14039918/state.json" "file_sha256" "44ec1632c3b5a1a9cc6f9ea87ed45cee2f5e75c2c11649b02c1231f992a01a04" "basis" 1394 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14039918/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-49178" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14039918/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "d152ab99adebc94a5b39667c0ceb80422e36ff776e0d5cc19bbdec1fcbd326c4" "basis" 1394 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14039918/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-49178" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14039918/state.json" "file_sha256" "44ec1632c3b5a1a9cc6f9ea87ed45cee2f5e75c2c11649b02c1231f992a01a04" "basis" 1394 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14039918/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-49178" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "1+\\operatorname{cos}⁡1"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14039918/state.json" "file_sha256" "44ec1632c3b5a1a9cc6f9ea87ed45cee2f5e75c2c11649b02c1231f992a01a04" "basis" 1394 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14039918/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-49178" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/math "1+\\operatorname{ln}⁡2\\pi +\\operatorname{cos}⁡2"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/